  "description": "Root-statistics LayerNorm composed with projected first-edge affine: fresh colored S2 pilot, then full1896-node H128S15 C64R128 factorial A=direct/full-vector, B=projected/full-vector, C=direct/root-statistics, D=projected/root-statistics. Twelve independent runtimes in ABCDDCBAACDB order, unchanged complete numerical audit after every capture. Compare A/C and B/D bitwise after collection; PE-local clocks exclude initialization and do not measure SDK end-to-end speed.",
